#: scenario7:scenario7_0AB00C9C_7603_4B7D_94F0_422B925F4353
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2d46aee1479bfecdfb9aa6d5004ed00bc4617e14686e319fd0426f215868c86
#. default-sha256: 68c7722104915f2befadacc62c47f4fbb0bf0b953f8531c55c2c5496d5798e51
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0AB00C9C_7603_4B7D_94F0_422B925F4353"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫It was the spring of my "
"fourteenth year."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫열네 살 때 ⟪k:13⟫봄이었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_96C5866C_6F64_4692_8371_78D096629E7A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 445ece11ee38ab45975483593238df75752c23435f9224f4577ed13de671094d
#. default-sha256: e05bb0b547c1db1b56b91942a0bfda68b09e1c5092857818f89975848342d631
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_96C5866C_6F64_4692_8371_78D096629E7A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I, for one, preferred it when the sun ⟪k:1⟫wasn’t⟪k:2⟫ out.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Not that sunlight would "
"kill me,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 ⟪k:1⟫햇살이 없는 게 한결 편하다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫있다고 죽는 건 아니지만――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8FBE7F3A_6B09_46E2_9E5E_F71067DF0D22
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fdc9152b66a24cf092d6db60d2deb2e8956be6bf5143479462c498e1d2457f2
#. default-sha256: c0e3ff67f5d217c3cd7e22cada76d898593d9e1b2854c53339733b1bb76d4394
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8FBE7F3A_6B09_46E2_9E5E_F71067DF0D22"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but if it was bright enough, the whole world was so white I could hardly see a thing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫강렬한 빛은 ⟪k:1⟫앞조차 안 보일 만큼 ⟪k:2⟫세계를 하얗게 만든다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_33EABD98_BC03_4C5B_A81A_10244168B25D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d914ab2606866e4c5af432633429452eecab8e51dcf06bb59049ea767ca18fb4
#. default-sha256: 41f7ce0752a0fb90a38915a561bd6d05b34ccf81adb7ef64b6a67b0571dec080
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_33EABD98_BC03_4C5B_A81A_10244168B25D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As I was meandering through the courtyard,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫안뜰을 정처 없이 걷다 보니――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_47DE9F2F_B236_42A3_8344_89543D58A343
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e56b422730c94b5ff5f488ee1477f25f14f08c6c560c6f9a56fb8f04b1baae3
#. default-sha256: 1876f5692a0d789d1bf0a91e9a8fdd59244be168b409d616970d2c36bd6b8867
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_47DE9F2F_B236_42A3_8344_89543D58A343"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I spotted someone I had never seen before."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫낯선 뒷모습이 보였다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_7A0FC6F3_CC1D_4374_8C85_9A990957566C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0b752d5d6416480250a1ef2872d6efb9113ab6f65123b731ad674141d440ca7
#. default-sha256: 380ceba878b20ff3e2db93c92e456f392da0643481c5b7575e5669df6b09854c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7A0FC6F3_CC1D_4374_8C85_9A990957566C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Who are you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………누구입니까."

#: scenario7:scenario7_55F98633_ED37_45A9_8D4F_1F8F68725FB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3171ce610e537ae067ad8f96c466b63d2d43b042a0545113397c139ef86f4c4
#. default-sha256: 7914786c9fd8a8e049d8723556ea63bfda708ddc955cd9dd73efb8a4468a6a72
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_55F98633_ED37_45A9_8D4F_1F8F68725FB4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I asked bluntly, and the girl twirled around, smiling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 무례한 질문에 ⟪k:1⟫그 사람은 나를 돌아보며 미소 지었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5541FDCB_DB15_422E_B325_810ED59E7372
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20f8f63a55a3077dae5fd893dc3d7c4f54ebc2e7201a0408fef117453a392a9c
#. default-sha256: b428352abfbe9e39fe2ea5295d6ec3c511fe670ed3786c53c63ff37601bb491d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5541FDCB_DB15_422E_B325_810ED59E7372"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My apologies. You just have such a beautiful courtyard here I let myself in for a "
"little walk."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫미안해, ⟪k:2⟫예쁜 안뜰이길래…… 절로 돌아다녔어."

#: scenario7:scenario7_45288BEE_D663_41C1_AF44_3429D72D3EE7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8bda64a5c7649f0491a341f066ba566d4252f0ecc2b45f1623052112ab0e01d
#. default-sha256: 4b1ae37715b404a59bf80f3ced7975274ce3614aa572c0b8dccf192dfea9000c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_45288BEE_D663_41C1_AF44_3429D72D3EE7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Long, chestnut hair flowed over round, feminine shoulders.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It swayed slightly in "
"the wind."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫긴 밤색 머리카락이 ⟪k:1⟫여성스러운 곡선을 자아내는 어깨 위에서 ⟪k:2⟫바람에 살랑거렸다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_0B2ABE52_A65A_4EF3_A1D8_199842CE8E31
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfee40b27505730330ade2504958f785e0a30a8c00eb1af2f18cd6aff0baace9
#. default-sha256: 226bdcf9c710415cb2707d1121d14d4cc00368b23725e41dd036ca6779d85727
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0B2ABE52_A65A_4EF3_A1D8_199842CE8E31"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The cloud of melancholy dissipated in the light of her smile."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫흐린 날씨 특유의 갑갑한 분위기를 ⟪k:1⟫여자의 미소가 없앴다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4D4E9084_E870_492E_A998_C5D99E26EDB7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb1c55dc7ac888196fdd590da87ea85b833fadf78fbf1bfce6a49aaca4a39c38
#. default-sha256: f354105fbff5695d615304386f00801028d886f802d411f1eed769c2ee659616
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4D4E9084_E870_492E_A998_C5D99E26EDB7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You must be Michelle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You’re just as pretty as I heard."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫너, ⟪k:2⟫미셸 맞지?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫얘기로 들은 대로야. ⟪k:5⟫참 예쁜 여자아이인걸."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CCB94BB0_F5ED_434C_B5C7_F0C5C7FCCBAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79c1ce8d43a836a2418421b2c4c46f8b81a54bc9bd3b27e5b480e17b6d0dbba1
#. default-sha256: 89a6643e13154a18395eb8e901b77b30b85d748c9a0140ada08717cb7e900c2b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CCB94BB0_F5ED_434C_B5C7_F0C5C7FCCBAA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Finally” meet me? What was she talking about?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As I stood there, baffled by this "
"strange woman,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫뭘 어떻게 잘 부탁하겠단 건지,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫영문도 모르고 서 있는 나에게――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0C0861C5_D4B4_453C_8326_7C12D391459E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f6b7f58096796049b18bbaa96fa0c27561ae38506098730c9256913ebaf7bc3
#. default-sha256: 7968d0858525622ba15d80ad401f0d29d26541b5f9d1e85e37d47c5e8ca7090f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0C0861C5_D4B4_453C_8326_7C12D391459E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’m thrilled to make your acquaintance, Michelle."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫안면을 터서 참 기뻐, ⟪k:2⟫미셸."

#: scenario7:scenario7_395D00B7_3D6A_4726_82D2_4B0208B5AAE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9e359d557fdbec1a207dbc7f79aa72fb5f11c7f75f0ac60c54103913328c14a
#. default-sha256: 0af9e790a26d5e9797dfaa187d5c52118dcb0740a224d97b4e7928fe2c01245b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_395D00B7_3D6A_4726_82D2_4B0208B5AAE9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her voice was like someone pouring honey into my ear."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 사람의 속삭임은 넋이 나갈 만큼 달콤하여――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2E190DA1_1B5B_42B8_9724_46FD4AEA5E64
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0d245992f00f1c2cae83c8cb527b2b137f7acd14a1646de6a34ed7047b1ed2c
#. default-sha256: e10e3f8458a093219b2cc946cfd48a299cbae6436e03db4c2f757c0978e5f475
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2E190DA1_1B5B_42B8_9724_46FD4AEA5E64"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫stuck another needle into my chest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 가슴을 찌르는 통증을 ⟪k:1⟫더욱 크게 키웠다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_92BD0387_003C_458B_BBFA_677D0840B7BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6338006a19b35dd7f432c66473162cb62b3f56dfbc93ea346469658094b5f2c
#. default-sha256: 043f0e8eb3033b909f47849c2ebb1d2cf3f30bd32610f8da7ed57643d590d7e4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_92BD0387_003C_458B_BBFA_677D0840B7BC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No one had told me my brother was to be married."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 차남이 어떤 교류를 가지는지도 ⟪k:1⟫전혀 듣지 못 했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2EA1FB27_A290_45D4_B001_ED2BAE059597
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc0d8e88f8c0a94bbe7178ea674fe097359f118022ed15ea467e5009f1e830f7
#. default-sha256: 6bb30facdd0cafbfdd01e4c6f74593f36ad8fe6733deda807a008832f3fc8f9e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2EA1FB27_A290_45D4_B001_ED2BAE059597"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My father Antonin looked so proud of his two boys—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Didier soon to receive his "
"assignment, and Georges soon to be wed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아버지는 곧 기사단에 배속될 장남 디디에와 ⟪k:1⟫결혼을 앞둔 차남 조르주를 자랑스럽게 여기는 모"
"양이었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_28390D52_0EA1_4574_8E8E_15A463F1A092
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72475f837bda99df8b1a1dcda8a5740e13e700cf9e475ed3f91924ebfd60d52b
#. default-sha256: 3de6b80e86272513a9bc9ed5e82e7f4652c9a49d8aa1bff76f9d2c328a7784fb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_28390D52_0EA1_4574_8E8E_15A463F1A092"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The banquet proceeded smoothly,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫만찬은 시종일관 화기애애한 분위기였으며――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_40ADECC1_364A_41F8_AF37_4F3E4BECF6B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0aac9980bc7eceea379b72ba1ac932b2a9f00243acde128bec1aaf6d1c587f95
#. default-sha256: 7a5038dd535e527cf30383bf3dba1a4211d6ca8f36ad4323013d81d0f800b1f5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_40ADECC1_364A_41F8_AF37_4F3E4BECF6B9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫not a doubt in the air that we were a happy family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 누구도 이 집안의 행복을 의심하지 않았다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_12A5BB5F_4099_4D82_9B68_037211FB700C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f9dff2e9a85de82b74aaafe9946dc84cdfe0be8920a0a9d66903782f6d811b1
#. default-sha256: 0f52fcbe2eaf3b979420f56b358a33b9145322dd981dc295257cad4a0e55a4de
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_12A5BB5F_4099_4D82_9B68_037211FB700C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But my mind was elsewhere."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나만이 ⟪k:1⟫다른 생각을 했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_42746B8F_4494_49DF_A79B_BBA692F85693
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2683eb07f364e3e1d900089035bccb0a6d696e25da99da05084cfd8487d7a57
#. default-sha256: 217d3171c7568cabb5d5767261d5f81b1027c1e0aca86e9fecd476c1ed7825c1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_42746B8F_4494_49DF_A79B_BBA692F85693"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I found myself unconsciously chasing Aimee with my eyes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어느새 에이미의 동작만 보았다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_82923E7B_2641_4CE0_85D9_3B478E646923
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6252bf600d3ad36fff7706596ccbc5778933eddc8a3f259c80b9f4b6ca8bb64
#. default-sha256: 349bed6da3a3883a17a330fce80f7c3525ed93bea550be60f5d94dbe2e2b91ad
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_82923E7B_2641_4CE0_85D9_3B478E646923"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Watching the way those slender fingers gripped her spoon.⟪k:1⟫Her full lips parting to allow "
"a piece of fruit in."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫은수저를 쥔 고운 손가락과 ⟪k:1⟫과일을 머금는 도톰한 입술."

#: scenario7:scenario7_991665B7_761E_4CBB_9097_F7C40F47BB38
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2458ede1a36c7291ea8cea25d924ea861dfcf7eb49cefb3f4021f0624449032
#. default-sha256: 731f0b0dd006572a83510e95f21215632dd039f0f23ffcb9a622e72c15ad1010
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_991665B7_761E_4CBB_9097_F7C40F47BB38"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her deep red tongue, visible for but the briefest of moments."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫입을 열 때 보이는 ⟪k:1⟫빨간 혀."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3AAE7B4F_BF85_459B_B8D0_40E238F55F91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a302833a9a289fd8b154aafd979598f4d3072e8ba0772d3fae5dca8d963b1cea
#. default-sha256: e41757fed4b6cefcc162e95b5bf4de3a2a6bffcb5d4022ee78295f8bdc849b46
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3AAE7B4F_BF85_459B_B8D0_40E238F55F91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The way all the muscles in her face seemed to relax in bliss as sweet juices seeped into her "
"mouth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫온화하게 내려간 눈꼬리."

#: scenario7:scenario7_936CDD6B_9C02_4118_9168_A93944FB0CB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d371adf9528b399bc3c2ce7a10683ea21d55c36e62d0a7736811bf6f60b5e8a9
#. default-sha256: 87ffa940363fe76767e09eac5b4001d8ffb50139bc125eb4d9554a9a31f93165
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_936CDD6B_9C02_4118_9168_A93944FB0CB5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The way she spoke, so soft and gentle, letting each sound hang in the air just briefly "
"before intoning the next."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫누구보다 나긋나긋하며 고운 목소리."

#: scenario7:scenario7_0D190A50_753D_446D_888B_297A70987ADE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22c0ea5d5baacb52a47556724972b9411d226246642f69ea1249ea2ce72ab87a
#. default-sha256: a8e0e557d85c4d9ae98dd622e583d3634561e17439931f74d68dfd3ef0c58e6f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0D190A50_753D_446D_888B_297A70987ADE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was distinctly feminine—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫in a different way than my mother."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어머니와 다른 여자의 향――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D0282D63_AB66_4BCD_B5CC_D26348888576
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a3d9082575edd511c85050a5e2b1aa86b8e2704a75c661cb491bc3746cac143
#. default-sha256: cb0e60d61b4e20c19a5f02dbbe16a0f03cd818ec985b1245d6c51df4e52bd9f8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D0282D63_AB66_4BCD_B5CC_D26348888576"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Apparently, Aimee was going to be living at the Bollinger estate for some time."
