msgid "⟪k:0⟫Then why are you holding me against the wall?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그럼 왜 ⟪k:1⟫이런 짓을 해!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_272A67D3_F4A5_4706_89C4_A55D0E0C478E
